OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABanned drug-driver admits killing
OL,4,Atwo in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAppearing at Carlisle Crown Court,
OL,7,FKevin Hooton, 42 and from Liverpool,
OL,8,Falso admitted causing death by careless
OL,9,Fdriving when unfit through drugs and
OL,10,Fcausing serious injury by dangerous
OL,11,Fdriving to Storey's partner Andrew
OL,12,FHolding, who was driving the black Ford
OL,13,FFocus Hooton crashed into.
OL,15,FHe will be sentenced at the same court
OL,16,Fon 21 December and was remanded in
OL,17,Fcustody until then.
